Tech stack I'd recommend

This is a stack I'd be comfortable maintaining for client sites:

Frontend: Your HTML/CSS/JavaScript site.
Backend: Node.js (Express) or Next.js API routes if you move to Next.js later.
Calendar: Google Calendar API (source of truth).
Payments: Stripe Checkout + webhooks.
Email: Resend (simple and reliable).
Database: None initially, or a lightweight database only if you later need customer history or custom reporting.


